@startuml
title Gate 分层架构与允许依赖方向
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Catalog" #D6EAF8 {
  component "Gate / TargetPreset" as gate_contracts
  component "RecipeStep" as recipe_dsl
  component "Python Check" as check_registry
}

package "Planning" #D5F5E3 {
  component "Input Snapshot" as change_snapshot
  component "Trigger Matcher" as trigger_matcher
  component "GatePlan" as gate_plan
}

package "Execution" #FDEBD0 {
  component "CommandInvocation" as command_invocation
  component "Run Orchestrator" as run_orchestrator
  component "StepResult / GateResult" as execution_results
}

package "Evidence / Presentation" #E8DAEF {
  database "RunReceipt" as run_receipt
  interface "Terminal Events" as terminal_events
}

package "Maintenance" #FADBD8 {
  component "Health Audit" as health_audit
}

gate_contracts --> trigger_matcher : S1 提供 Gate 与 TargetPreset 合同
recipe_dsl --> gate_plan : S2 提供 RecipeStep 合同
check_registry --> gate_plan : S3 提供 Python Check owner
change_snapshot --> trigger_matcher : S4 提供冻结输入
trigger_matcher --> gate_plan : S5 提供匹配与未触发理由
gate_plan --> command_invocation : S6 适配真实进程
gate_plan --> run_orchestrator : S7 编排冻结计划
command_invocation --> run_orchestrator : S8 监管进程生命周期
run_orchestrator --> execution_results : S9 分类 owner outcome
execution_results --> run_receipt : S10 固化运行证据
execution_results --> terminal_events : S11 呈现执行状态
run_receipt --> health_audit : S12 审计不可变证据
terminal_events --> health_audit : S13 审计可解释事件

legend right
  |= 规则 |= 含义 |
  | 允许依赖 | 同阶段，或严格由上至下的阶段输出 |
  | 唯一方向 | Catalog → Planning → Execution → Evidence / Presentation → Maintenance |
  | 禁止依赖 | 向上逆向依赖、Evidence 与 Presentation 互相依赖 |
  | 禁止 helper | 不得用跨阶段 support、utils 或同名 helper 绕过边界 |
  | 状态边界 | PASS / BLOCKED / FAIL 为执行状态；NOT_TRIGGERED 仅为选择状态 |
endlegend
@enduml
